# Allow-list: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies.
# (data/, models/, notebooks, dist/ and the conda env never reach the daemon)
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements-serve.lock
!requirements-dev.lock
!api/
!src/
!tests/
!reports/*.csv
!dashboard/
dashboard/node_modules/
dashboard/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
